Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:06.10,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.82,0:00:07.66,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,1785,5650,6820)\pos(637.273,466.891)}Episode 8 \N\N\N\N\N\NThrice Offering of Xú Province
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.66,0:00:36.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(308.637,508.637)\fade(255,0,255,0,500,2060,2420)}Táo Qiān\NStyled: "Gōngzǔ"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful on the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.12,0:00:37.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. Please rest assured, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.98,0:00:49.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(916.818,488.182)\fade(255,0,255,0,200,1800,2160)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: "Mèngdé"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.88,0:00:48.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Táo Qiān's men have murdered my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.46,0:00:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,He will be avenged!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.46,0:00:53.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Xiàhóu Dūn will lead the vanguard.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.46,0:00:55.46,Default,,0,0,0,,If anyone dares to aid the Xú-province...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.46,0:00:58.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Show no mercy!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.01,0:00:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.42,0:01:13.50,Thinking,,0,0,0,,After Cáo Cāo failed to defeat Dǒng Zhuó,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:17.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,he garrisoned his forces at Shāndōng
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:20.14,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,and ordered his men to\N leave for Lángyá Commandery
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.14,0:01:23.82,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,to pick up his father and his household and bring them back to Shāndōng.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.42,0:01:28.75,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Along the way in Xú Province, Táo Qiān,\Nseeking to become allies with Cáo Cāo,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:33.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,sent his subordinate, Zhāng Kǎi, \Nto escort his father along the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.92,0:01:35.98,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,But Zhāng Kǎi wanted to seize his wealth
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.98,0:01:39.26,Thinking,NTP,0,0,0,,and so, en route, he murdered his entire household.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.86,0:01:47.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo, furious from this, \Nled his soldiers to annihilate Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:56.14,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(964.545,484.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,450,1660,1950)}Chén Gōng\NStyled: "Gōngtái"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.58,0:02:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If I could save the people of Xú Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I would hand over its provincial seal to Cáo Cāo,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.80,0:03:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and let him execute me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.15,0:03:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please don't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:20.10,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(310,477.273)\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4750,5100)}Mí Zhú\NStyled: "Zizhòng"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.52,0:03:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you have long governed Xú Province! The people love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:26.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But Cáo's army is mighty!\N We can't beat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.42,0:03:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,But he hasn't breached the walls of Xú Province's capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.42,0:03:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You and the people need to unite!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.86,0:03:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me exit the city! I will ask \NKǒng Róng for reinforcements!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.08,0:03:48.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But if they don't arrive soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.64,0:03:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,the city will have been breached!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.72,0:03:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}"Father of Lord Cáo, Sōng."{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.96,0:04:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, there's someone called Chén Gōng who wishes to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't see anyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.94,0:04:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.06,0:04:19.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.72,0:04:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.00,0:04:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Chén Gōng.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Which Chén Gōng?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The magistrate who released you in Zhōngmu county,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,that Chén Gōng.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.96,0:04:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Call him in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.24,0:04:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:05.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngtái, have you been well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.62,0:05:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I am doing fine, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.72,0:05:17.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder now, Gōngtái, where have you been since we last met?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.36,0:05:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I am stationed in Dōng Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.76,0:05:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a good post you have!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you jest.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I always knew you and\Nthat Táo Qiān were good friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.12,0:05:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you come to plead for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.52,0:05:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly the reason why I have come.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.62,0:06:03.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, to avenge your esteemed father, you sent an army to siege Xú Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.08,0:06:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,but Táo Qiān is a benevolent lord and not one to abandon justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.96,0:06:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father's death was due to Zhāng Kǎi, not Táo Qiān's.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.32,0:06:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, what animosity could you have towards the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet wherever you march...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.80,0:06:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What you're doing is a massacre!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.00,0:06:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Chén Gōng, back then you abandoned me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What right do you have to talk to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.84,0:06:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Táo Qiān murdered my entire family.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.74,0:06:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I vowed to rip out his gall \Nand cut out his heart for vengeance!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But sire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.06,0:07:20.78,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(371.363,470.455)}Kǒng Róng\NStyled: "Wénjǔ"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.48,0:07:21.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Táo Gōngzǔ can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.78,0:07:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a plan to repel the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.95,0:07:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to introduce you to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.12,0:07:28.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.89,0:07:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:33.18,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Please enter, Lord Liú!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.02,0:07:50.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(439.545,484.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,390,6050,6380)}Liú Bèi\NStyled: "Xuándé"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.48,0:07:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Mí, I've long known about the situation in Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.61,0:07:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Táo Gōngzǔ is a benevolent lord.\NHe should not suffer for other's guilt.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.52,0:07:57.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Sir, during the Eighteen Lord's expedition against Dǒng Zhuó,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.91,0:08:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,have you heard of Sir Liú, Guān, and Zhāng, who fought Lü Bù at the Hǔláo Pass?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.54,0:08:04.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(975.455,497.727)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: "Yúncháng"
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.82,0:08:06.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Liú is a true champion of our time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.18,0:08:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If he can come aid \NXú Province, he can lift the siege.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.68,0:08:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir, I've long known about your righteousness, {\bord12}and your ability to save those in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now Xú Province stands alone, the people are in peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Please deliver us from this threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.62,0:08:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lord Xuándé, you are a scion of the Imperial House.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.50,0:08:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now Cáo Cāo attacks and subjugates the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.96,0:08:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Why not come to their rescue?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.98,0:08:43.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I wouldn't dare refuse, but I lack the troops to take drastic action.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.82,0:08:48.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, I want to save Táo Gōngzǔ,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.05,0:08:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}not just for our friendship,\Nbut also for justice!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.20,0:08:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, how could you not uphold justice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.02,0:08:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Administrator Kǒng.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.26,0:09:00.50,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(307.273,484.091)\fade(255,0,255,0,490,4820,5220)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.02,0:09:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case, lend us your forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.03,0:09:06.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,and let me go to Gōngsūn Zàn to borrow 35,000 troops. I will be back afterwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.78,0:09:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.52,0:09:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky to have met a hero like yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.72,0:09:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! Tomorrow, I will provide you with the troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:22.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope you won't go back on your word.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:28.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir, who do you think I am?\NThe sages have said,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"Without trust, a man cannot stand."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.62,0:09:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Whether I bring back soldiers or not,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.12,0:09:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I will return to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.52,0:09:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.10,0:10:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You were right, Liú Xuándé truly is a just hero!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.64,0:10:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,With Lord Xuándé here, Xú Province is saved!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.06,0:10:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.30,0:10:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Open the city gates!\NOpen the gates for him!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.96,0:10:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liú arrives!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.84,0:10:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.92,0:10:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I was afraid that you had no provisions left
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.94,0:10:45.34,Default,,0,0,0,,and wouldn't hold out for long,\N so I forced my way in
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,to strategize a way to make the enemy retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.94,0:10:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,To have you come to our rescue,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.12,0:10:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,truly, it's a sign of mercy\N to the people of Xú Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.94,0:11:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mí Zhú.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.52,0:11:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.38,0:11:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Get the Seal of Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.38,0:11:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.52,0:11:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, what is this for?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.94,0:11:33.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The nation is in great disorder, \Nits imperium lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.38,0:11:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Sir, you are a scion of the Hàn, you can support the nation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.38,0:11:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I'm but an old man now, too feeble.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:52.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I would gladly gift you Xú Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.03,0:11:52.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.04,0:12:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Your words spoken thus have humbled me greatly.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.31,0:12:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Though I am of the Hàn dynasty, \NI'm of only humble merits and virtue.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.66,0:12:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I only hold a lowly office at Píngyuán.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.41,0:12:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I am here only for the common good.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.88,0:12:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, the words you spoke...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.18,0:12:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Does sire suspect I desire \Nto annex Xú Province?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.04,0:12:24.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If I harbored such thoughts, \Nmay Heavens abandon me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,My words are sincere!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.82,0:12:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I will submit a memorial to the \Nimperial court of my will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, sir, please accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.86,0:12:41.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.88,0:12:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, right now our foes are besieging our gates.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.76,0:12:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Our priority should be to repel them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.10,0:12:59.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, what Lord Liú spoke is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.46,0:13:06.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.21,0:13:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good! I will write to Cáo Cāo\N to urge his retreat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If he refuses, then we will strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Good, good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.84,0:13:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who does Liú Bèi think he is,\N asking me to retreat?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.66,0:13:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mocking me between the lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.80,0:13:41.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Come!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.02,0:13:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.60,0:13:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Kill the messenger.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.14,0:13:50.42,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(364.545,463.637)\fade(255,0,255,0,600,3755,4100)}Guō Jiā \NStyled: "Fèngxiào"
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, Liú Bèi has come afar, \Nyet negotiates before using force.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.54,0:13:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord should reply with courtesy, lower his guard,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.46,0:13:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,then assault the city walls! The city will fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.40,0:13:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir! An urgent report for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.28,0:14:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Pass it!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.44,0:14:08.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Report! Lü Bù followed Chén Gōng's plan\Nand captured Shāndōng!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.90,0:14:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me the reports!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.56,0:14:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Cáo Rén has reported,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.00,0:14:17.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"Recently, Chén Gōng of Dōng County\Njoined Zhāng Miǎo,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.00,0:14:20.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"and advised Lü Bù to seize Shāndōng and advance into Púyáng."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.72,0:14:25.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}"We only have Juànchéng, Dōng'e, and Fàn County left, thanks to Xún Yù and others' last ditch effort."
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.68,0:14:27.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}"The rest were taken by Lü Bù!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Cáo Rén couldn't win them back,\Nso he requested aid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.04,0:14:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}After that, Lü Bù was forced by Lǐ Jué and Guō Sì to leave Cháng'ān.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.38,0:14:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}He joined Yuán Shù,\Nand then joined Yuán Shào.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.03,0:14:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}He left him and then Zhāng Yáng\Nto join Zhāng Miǎo like a cur!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.38,0:14:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Lü Bù is a reckless fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.64,0:14:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Who would've thought, that trivial\N Chén Gōng would be able to do this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.38,0:14:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}just for my refusal over Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.08,0:14:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My lord, Shāndōng is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.74,0:14:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We have no home to return to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.38,0:15:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The only way back is to retake our lost lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.30,0:15:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}What the General has spoke is true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:05.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The retaliation against Xú Province\N must be delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.72,0:15:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Better to do Liú Bèi a favor \Nand withdraw to retake Shāndōng instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.50,0:16:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,We withdraw.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.44,0:16:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liú arrives!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.24,0:16:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liú, your letter saved us all!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.58,0:16:30.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you are wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.90,0:16:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only a small favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.34,0:16:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Please! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Good!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.32,0:16:49.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I have prepared light wine.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.64,0:16:56.06,Default,,0,0,0,,A banquet for all you loyal and righteous heroes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.34,0:17:01.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.72,0:17:03.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.96,0:17:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.80,0:17:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, I have something to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.20,0:17:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask you gentlemen to heed it well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.48,0:17:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I am old and ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.76,0:17:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My two sons are incapable of administering the province.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.72,0:17:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuándé is of the imperial clan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.72,0:17:40.02,Default,,0,0,0,,With his virtue and talent, he can lead Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.72,0:17:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I am willing to retire and heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.22,0:17:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Kǒng Wénjǔ wanted me to save Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.14,0:17:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a just act. I'm not here to seize Xú Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.14,0:17:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,lest I be known as corrupt and disloyal.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.48,0:18:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.70,0:18:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The Hàn Empire is declining and the realm is in anarchy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.24,0:18:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Now is the time to rebuild.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.72,0:18:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Xú Province is rich, with households numbering tens of thousands.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.26,0:18:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liú, you are fit to lead us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.14,0:18:18.02,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the place where you can lead by example.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.02,0:18:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you mustn't refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.32,0:18:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't dare accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.10,0:18:31.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(972.727,501.818)\fade(255,0,255,0,415,4345,4820)}Chén Dēng\NStyled: "Yuánlóng"
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Táo is constantly ill \Nand mustn't manage affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.35,0:18:32.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you have to accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.98,0:18:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, Yuán Gōnglù's clan has served as the Three Excellencies for four generations.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.08,0:18:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Those within the Four Seas look up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.14,0:18:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,And he resides at Shòuchūn, near here.\NWhy not let him have Xú Province?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuán Shù is but a corpse in a tomb!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.86,0:18:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Why bother with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.18,0:18:59.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuándé, this is a chance sent by the Heavens.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.07,0:19:02.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you refuse it,\Nthen you will regret it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.58,0:19:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No! I can't accept!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.66,0:19:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuándé, if you refuse me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.38,0:19:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I will not rest in peace!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.78,0:19:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, you should accept Lord Táo's offer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.36,0:19:26.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, you are fit to lead Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.82,0:19:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right! It's not like we are forcing him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.62,0:19:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He wants to resign,\Nbut you decline?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.34,0:19:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want to entice me to treachery?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.28,0:19:57.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, I dare not accept your offer of Xú Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.96,0:20:06.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Xuándé, if you are unwilling to do so,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.72,0:20:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a small city near here, called Xiǎopèi.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.35,0:20:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You may garrison there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.34,0:20:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, would you please garrison there\Nfor some time to protect Xú Province?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.70,0:20:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.80,0:20:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.79,0:20:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir Xuándé has no need to decline, surely?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.80,0:20:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we can all rest assured.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.84,0:20:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.78,0:20:42.34,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(334.545,484.091)}Lü Bù\NStyled: "Fèngxiān"
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.16,0:20:50.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Bù!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.88,0:20:54.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We had no quarrel between us!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.86,0:20:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you steal my territory?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.96,0:20:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone has a share of the Empire's land.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.73,0:21:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can you seize Xú Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.44,0:21:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,yet I cannot take Shāndōng?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Wretched Lü Bu!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.84,0:21:16.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is willing to take down Lü Bu?! End his arrogance!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.62,0:21:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Chén Gōng! A lowly magistrate like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.95,0:21:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you dare serve a wolf and spur his troops!?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You will die for this!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.32,0:21:38.58,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo rushed back to \NShāndōng to fight with Lü Bù.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.64,0:21:45.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Chén Gōng kept on making plans to make Cáo Cāo lose one conflict after another.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.68,0:21:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Cáo Cāo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.50,0:21:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,That man riding a yellow horse!\NThat's him!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.70,0:21:56.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.48,0:22:09.66,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, go! My lord, go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.10,0:22:15.46,Thinking,,0,0,0,,In the Battle of Púyáng, \NCáo Cāo almost lost his life,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.36,0:22:19.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,the same year that locusts started to swarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.52,0:22:25.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo, with his provisions empty due to this,\Nhad to retreat to Ju'àn City.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.02,0:22:30.55,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Lü Bù also retreated and fortified inside Púyáng.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:34.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,And thus, the conflict ceased.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.68,0:22:56.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Cáo's army has left...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.08,0:23:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be due to Lü Bù's attack on Shāndōng...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.34,0:23:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,They may have retreated, \Nbut they will return by spring.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.60,0:23:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,I can't help but to recall...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.70,0:23:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,...the massacre Cáo's army did in Xú Province...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.08,0:23:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you must not worry about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.99,0:23:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Chén Dēng already went to Xiǎopèi\Nto summon Lord Liú here a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.56,0:23:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Xú Province... Do you think...?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.02,0:23:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you tried to resign twice to Xuándé.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.50,0:23:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, you were still healthy enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.02,0:23:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,so Lord Xuándé wouldn't accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.22,0:23:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you are ill, \Nhe will not be able to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.68,0:24:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope so...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.68,0:24:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.64,0:24:44.34,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, how has your condition gotten to this?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.34,0:24:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Rise... Rise... Bring seating...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.38,0:24:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you must rest assured. Don't-
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.78,0:25:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I know... once Cáo Cāo takes revenge on Lü Bù...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.78,0:25:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,...He will come for us too...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.78,0:25:15.14,Default,,0,0,0,,... Xú Province... is in crisis!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.12,0:25:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Please sir... take pity on the poor people!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.58,0:25:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Preserve this city for the sake of the House of Hàn!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.62,0:25:28.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.24,0:25:41.42,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, you have two sons. \NWhy not let them inherit this duty?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.06,0:25:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of my sons are able...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.64,0:25:50.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,After I die... I hope you will tutor them...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.76,0:25:54.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,But never let them into political affairs...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.32,0:26:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I be prepared\Nfor this great responsibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.96,0:26:08.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me recommend one person... That can assist you...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.58,0:26:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He is called Sūn Qián, of Běihǎi.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.36,0:26:22.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Zizhòng.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.68,0:26:22.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.94,0:26:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Lord Liú is a champion of the times...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.96,0:26:33.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope... you will serve him well...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.08,0:26:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.64,0:26:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.92,0:27:09.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Order all in Xú Province to attend the mourning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.14,0:27:10.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.72,0:27:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,What? That bastard Táo Qiān has died?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.20,0:27:24.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,That Liú Bèi took over Xú Province with no effort?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.94,0:27:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,He's pushing his luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.44,0:27:30.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I will kill Liú Bèi first,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.06,0:27:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,then dig out and flay that Táo Qiān's corpse, and avenge my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.88,0:27:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord, what is your order?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.62,0:27:35.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.82,0:27:39.26,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(330.455,490.909)\fade(255,0,255,0,415,2945,3420)}Xún Yù\NStyled: "Wénruò"
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.00,0:27:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, do not send an army to Xú Province this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.28,0:27:42.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.19,0:27:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Of old, Hàn Gāozǔ guarded Guānzhōng, and Hàn Guāngwǔ occupied Hénèi.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.42,0:27:50.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Both of them were deep-rooted and had firm foundations.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.42,0:27:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}It was enough for them to advance and to retreat whilst having a strong base.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.29,0:27:58.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}That was how they realized their great undertaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.60,0:28:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If you take Xú Province today with too many soldiers, it will be hard to maintain;
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.80,0:28:09.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}too few soldiers left, then Lü Bù will take advantage and seize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.92,0:28:15.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}If you lose Shāndōng \Nand fail to take Xú Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.60,0:28:19.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}then where would sire retreat?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.00,0:28:25.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Even if I let go of my grudge,\NI will still obtain Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.96,0:28:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Cáo Rén and Xiàhóu Dūn!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.80,0:28:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.46,0:28:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You two guard Ju'ànchéng!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.20,0:28:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.99,0:28:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Eliminate Lü Bù first, remove all potential obstacles.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.49,0:28:40.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.04,0:29:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Rally the remnants of our army!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.18,0:29:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I will end that bastard Cáo!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.58,0:29:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,General, Cáo's army is powerful. \NYou cannot compete with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.56,0:29:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to find refuge first, \Nand then can we take revenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.62,0:29:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But when you told me to take Shāndōng, you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.04,0:29:35.78,Default,,0,0,0,,"Cáo Cāo is nothing to be afraid of!"
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.24,0:29:59.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Gōngtái, what if I ally with Yuán Shào again.\NHow does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.78,0:30:04.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,You've left Yuán Shào before.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.40,0:30:08.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,General, your arrogance cost us nearly all our soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.88,0:30:13.34,Default,,0,0,0,,If you attempt to join him again,\NI fear there is no room.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.90,0:30:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We can first send scouts to Jì Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.20,0:30:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,if Yuán Shào won't tolerate us, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.76,0:30:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps joining with Liú Bèi.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.54,0:30:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.24,0:30:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to save Xú Province\N but now...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.32,0:30:51.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Lü Bù is a beast! He mustn't be taken in!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.00,0:30:53.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He will bring harm!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.28,0:31:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for Lü Bù's attack at Shāndōng,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.64,0:31:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,we wouldn't have rescued Xú Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.00,0:31:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Today, he came to me in need.\N How could I let him down?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.52,0:31:17.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, you are too kind. Even so, be vigilant.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.68,0:31:20.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yide, you will come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.86,0:31:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring my horse!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.18,0:31:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.18,0:32:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}After I plotted with the Excellency of the Masses Wáng, to kill Dǒng Zhuō,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.18,0:32:21.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}we were attacked by Lǐ Jué and Guō Sì, so I wandered east.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.92,0:32:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The other lords refused to provide shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.12,0:32:32.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Today, I came here to join you.\NWe'll achieve great things together.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.67,0:32:35.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.72,0:32:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When Cáo Cāo marched to attack Xú Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.48,0:32:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}we were able to break his siege thanks to your capture of Shandong.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.38,0:32:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Now with Lord Táo's passing, and no one left to govern Xú Province,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.11,0:32:54.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I stepped up to manage the provincial affairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.08,0:32:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Fortunately, with your presence, I can step down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.60,0:33:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I am but a warrior,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.85,0:33:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}how could I administer a province?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.39,0:33:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}General, please accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.40,0:33:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}As is it said,\N"a strong guest does not oppress the owner."
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.56,0:33:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Please don't doubt us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.06,0:33:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If so...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.06,0:33:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}See, when I captured Shāndōng,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.28,0:34:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I hoped to establish a base to achieve my cause
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.06,0:34:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but fell to that treacherous Cáo's trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.40,0:34:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My army suffered, losing most of its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.56,0:34:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now that you have taken me in,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.18,0:34:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}in the midst of grim circumstances,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.44,0:34:28.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I am grateful and indebted \Nto sire's righteousness and compassion.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.16,0:34:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come! Bring them out to pay respects to our lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.32,0:34:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,My family now has a place to live, \Nthanks to Lord Liú's generosity.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.84,0:34:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You must bow down to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.22,0:34:55.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, no! Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.34,0:34:57.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother, there is no need to be humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.84,0:35:02.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My Elder Brother is kin of the Hàn!\NWho do you think you are!?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.46,0:35:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You dare claim him as your brother?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.10,0:35:06.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Get over here! Let me have at him!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.78,0:35:10.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Even my Elder Brother\N refused to accept the seal many times!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.30,0:35:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet why should a cur like you deserve Xú Province!?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.90,0:35:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,My younger brother is just raving. Please don't blame him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.68,0:35:44.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you for your choice to receive rather than refuse me
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.72,0:35:50.14,Default,,0,0,0,,But since your younger brother\Nwon't tolerate me...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.72,0:35:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I... I will seek refuge elsewhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.26,0:35:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,General!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.72,0:36:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you go, then it's my great mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.22,0:36:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My younger brother was just raving,\NI'll make him apologize to you another day.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.12,0:36:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Better I just go!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.18,0:36:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There is a place called Xiǎopèi, where you can stock up on soldiers and provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.80,0:36:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,General, if you don't mind, \Nyou may garrison your men there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.18,0:36:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Good military supplies should\N make up for this offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.64,0:36:45.62,Default,,0,0,0,,General, if...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.36,0:36:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.32,0:37:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.48,0:37:29.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When the Son of Heaven\N moved the capital to Luòyáng,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.68,0:37:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}news of him hounded by Lǐ and Guō \Npassed to Shāndōng,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.24,0:37:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}shocking Cáo Cāo and all officers, who had only been planning an assault on Xú Province.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.26,0:37:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.32,0:37:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Though Liú Bèi took in Lü Bù, I think plans for Xú Province ought to be delayed.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.82,0:37:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that the Emperor has moved to Luòyáng,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.56,0:38:04.06,Default,,0,0,0,,this is a matter of great \Nimportance that we need to consider.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.66,0:38:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Of old, Duke Wén of Jìn reinstated King Xiāng of Zhōu, all the nobles accepted that.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.66,0:38:13.66,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: When King Xiāng of Zhōu was deposed by his brother. \NDuke Wén of Jìn used his power to reinstate the deposed King.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.42,0:38:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}When Emperor Gāozǔ of Hàn mourned over Emperor Yì,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.66,0:38:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}the whole world swore allegiance to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.66,0:38:19.10,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Yì was the Emperor of Chǔ, formerly King Huai II.\NHe was murdered by Xiàng Yǔ, Gāozǔ's rival.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.18,0:38:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Now the Son of Heaven has lost his power and fled.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.06,0:38:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}My sir, if you were to call upon a righteous cause,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.94,0:38:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}receiving the will of the Emperor and the people,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.02,0:38:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}you could re-establish the Heavenly order.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.32,0:38:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If you don't act now, then others will act first!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.14,0:38:43.87,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The Son of Heaven lost his power...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.87,0:38:46.31,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}...if called upon a righteous cause...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.31,0:38:48.76,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}...to receive the Emperor and the people's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.76,0:38:51.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}It would be to re-establish the Heavenly order.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.30,0:38:55.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If I don't act now, then others will act first!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.64,0:39:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The Son of Heaven thus orders Cáo Cāo to enter the imperial court and assist the royal family!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.69,0:39:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Cáo Cāo, accept this order!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.26,0:39:24.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Your minister, Cáo Cāo, accepts!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.88,0:39:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn it all?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.16,0:39:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.36,0:39:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,General, spare me!\NPlease spare me for this offense!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.64,0:40:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I received the nation's grace, of which I shall repay!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.62,0:40:27.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Under orders, I shall escort the Emperor to the palace, for the spirits of the nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.07,0:40:30.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I call upon righteous soldiers against all adversity!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.08,0:40:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We shall march as legion invincible!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.88,0:40:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Save the Emperor! Onward to Luòyáng! March!

